<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>公司營運統計 · 米胡電競 MiHu Gaming</title><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business-analytics.css"></head>
<body class="mihu-admin-page text-light"><div class="app-layout"><%- include('partials/sidebar', { activePage: 'analytics' }) %><div class="main-wrapper"><%- include('partials/navbar', { activePage: 'analytics' }) %><main class="content-body admin-page-content analytics-page"><%- include('partials/admin_page_header', { icon: 'fa-chart-line', title: '公司營運統計', description: '查看工作室營收、訂單、會員與資金流動趨勢' }) %>
<% if (error) { %><div class="admin-error-state" role="alert"><div class="admin-error-state__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i></div><strong class="admin-error-state__title">營運統計載入失敗</strong><p class="admin-error-state__description"><%= error %></p></div><% } else { %>
<form class="admin-toolbar analytics-toolbar admin-panel" method="GET" action="/management/analytics"><div class="admin-form-group"><label class="admin-form-label" for="analyticsRange">日期範圍</label><select class="admin-form-select" id="analyticsRange" name="range"><option value="today" <%= analytics.period.range === 'today' ? 'selected' : '' %>>今天</option><option value="7d" <%= analytics.period.range === '7d' ? 'selected' : '' %>>近 7 天</option><option value="30d" <%= analytics.period.range === '30d' ? 'selected' : '' %>>近 30 天</option><option value="this_month" <%= analytics.period.range === 'this_month' ? 'selected' : '' %>>本月</option><option value="last_month" <%= analytics.period.range === 'last_month' ? 'selected' : '' %>>上月</option><option value="custom" <%= analytics.period.range === 'custom' ? 'selected' : '' %>>自訂區間</option></select></div><div class="admin-form-group"><label class="admin-form-label" for="analyticsFrom">開始日期</label><input class="admin-form-control" id="analyticsFrom" name="from" type="date" value="<%= analytics.period.from %>"></div><div class="admin-form-group"><label class="admin-form-label" for="analyticsTo">結束日期</label><input class="admin-form-control" id="analyticsTo" name="to" type="date" value="<%= analytics.period.to %>"></div><div class="admin-form-actions"><button type="submit" class="admin-btn admin-btn-primary">套用篩選</button></div></form>
<div class="analytics-kpi-grid"><article class="admin-panel analytics-kpi"><div class="analytics-kpi__label">營收</div><div class="analytics-kpi__value">NT$<%= analytics.summary.revenue.toLocaleString() %></div><div class="analytics-kpi__context">完成訂單 total_amount</div></article><article class="admin-panel analytics-kpi"><div class="analytics-kpi__label">完成訂單</div><div class="analytics-kpi__value"><%= analytics.summary.completedOrders.toLocaleString() %></div><div class="analytics-kpi__context">期間完成狀態</div></article><article class="admin-panel analytics-kpi"><div class="analytics-kpi__label">平均訂單金額</div><div class="analytics-kpi__value">NT$<%= analytics.summary.aov.toLocaleString() %></div><div class="analytics-kpi__context">營收 ÷ 完成訂單</div></article><article class="admin-panel analytics-kpi"><div class="analytics-kpi__label">新增會員</div><div class="analytics-kpi__value"><%= analytics.summary.newMembers.toLocaleString() %></div><div class="analytics-kpi__context">users.created_at</div></article></div>
<div class="analytics-panels"><section class="admin-panel analytics-panel"><div class="admin-panel-header"><h2 class="admin-section-title">每日營運趨勢</h2><p class="admin-section-description">Asia/Taipei 日期分桶，僅顯示 aggregate</p></div><div class="analytics-panel__body"><% if (!analytics.trend.length) { %><div class="admin-empty-state"><div class="admin-empty-state__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div><p class="admin-empty-state__title">此期間尚無營運資料</p></div><% } else { %><table class="analytics-trend-table"><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th class="text-end">訂單</th><th class="text-end">營收</th></tr></thead><tbody><% analytics.trend.forEach(day => { %><tr><td><%= day.date %></td><td class="analytics-number"><%= day.orders %></td><td class="analytics-number">NT$<%= day.revenue.toLocaleString() %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table><% } %></div></section><section class="admin-panel analytics-panel"><div class="admin-panel-header"><h2 class="admin-section-title">資金流動摘要</h2><p class="admin-section-description">Wallet Ledger 與 Payout source 分開呈現</p></div><div class="analytics-panel__body"><dl class="analytics-summary-list"><div><dt>會員儲值</dt><dd>NT$<%= analytics.wallet.topup.toLocaleString() %></dd></div><div><dt>會員消費</dt><dd>NT$<%= analytics.wallet.consumption.toLocaleString() %></dd></div><div><dt>退款回補</dt><dd>NT$<%= analytics.wallet.refund.toLocaleString() %></dd></div><div><dt>待處理提領</dt><dd>NT$<%= analytics.payouts.pending.toLocaleString() %></dd></div><div><dt>已撥款提領</dt><dd>NT$<%= analytics.payouts.paid.toLocaleString() %></dd></div></dl><p class="analytics-note">Wallet flow 不等於公司營收；待處理提領不視為已支出。</p></div></section><section class="admin-panel analytics-panel"><div class="admin-panel-header"><h2 class="admin-section-title">訂單狀態分布</h2><p class="admin-section-description">未知狀態保留為原始 code</p></div><div class="analytics-panel__body"><dl class="analytics-summary-list"><% analytics.statuses.forEach(item => { %><div><dt><%= item.status %></dt><dd><%= item.count %> 筆</dd></div><% }) %></dl></div></section></div>
<% } %></main></div></div><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script></body></html>
